                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7218056-ef7f-3a19-b43f-52a66467a097",
                                        "entry_id": "88c49148-d778-3f81-8665-69c5003e8007",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Worn and squalid-looking; bedraggled or decrepit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43fc8359-1ec7-49d5-b749-cb15f06dacb1",
                                                "sense_id": "a7218056-ef7f-3a19-b43f-52a66467a097",
                                                "text": "We stayed in a really mangy hotel in New York."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "366fc84d-8595-4e3e-9eae-68514b9bf565",
                                                "sense_id": "a7218056-ef7f-3a19-b43f-52a66467a097",
                                                "text": "When we came abreast again, they faced the river, stamped their feet, nodded their horned heads, swayed their scarlet bodies; they shook towards the fierce river-demon a bunch of black feathers, a mangy skin with a pendent tail— something that looked a dried gourd; they shouted periodically together strings of amazing words that resembled no sounds of human language; and the deep murmurs of the crowd, interrupted suddenly, were like the responses of some satanic litany."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4d4f635-4b86-4c87-a903-e5624896e2a7",
                                                "sense_id": "a7218056-ef7f-3a19-b43f-52a66467a097",
                                                "text": "Specter Knight: 'YOUR QUEST TO BECOME KING OF CARDS HAS NOT... GONE UNNOTICED.' / King Knight: 'AH, WORD HAS REACHED THE SLUMS, HAS IT? AM I TO TRAVEL WITH AN ENTOURAGE OF MANGY BEGGARS, NOW?'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ae43425-684f-3dda-a419-924e5da6fc8b",
                                        "entry_id": "88c49148-d778-3f81-8665-69c5003e8007",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Contemptible, despicable, low."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "837c7ac9-32f4-4613-9e03-076575ebb41f",
                                                "sense_id": "7ae43425-684f-3dda-a419-924e5da6fc8b",
                                                "text": "And he smote Corinius on his shaven jowl with the dice box, calling him cheat and mangy rascal, whereupon Corinius drew forth a bodkin to smite him in the neck withal; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
